0 - National, except those indicated in codes 3, 4, 5 and 8;
1 - Foreign - Direct import, except the one indicated in code 6;
2 - Foreign - Acquired in the domestic market, except the one indicated in code 7;
3 - National, merchandise or goods with Import Content greater than 40% and less than or equal to 70%;
4 - National, whose production was made in accordance with the basic productive processes dealt with in the legislation cited in the Adjustments;
5 - National, merchandise or goods with Import Content less than or equal to 40%;
6 - Foreign - Direct import, without national equivalent, listed in CAMEX and natural gas;
7 - Foreign - Acquired in the domestic market, without national equivalent, listed in CAMEX and natural gas;
8 - National, merchandise or goods with Import Content greater than 70%.
